# Applied on top of Firecracker's CI guest config.
# Base: `firecracker-6.18.config` is a byte-for-byte copy of Firecracker
# v1.17.0's x86_64 6.18 CI guest config (`diff` against the tag is empty):
# Source: https://github.com/firecracker-microvm/firecracker/blob/95f868c8e345b1cc8faccd1a3c910b4989dc3f58/resources/guest_configs/microvm-kernel-ci-x86_64-6.18.config
# Reference: https://github.com/firecracker-microvm/firecracker/blob/95f868c8e345b1cc8faccd1a3c910b4989dc3f58/docs/rootfs-and-kernel-setup.md
# In that base, HWMON is off (left unset, L2240) and
# THERMAL_HWMON absent; FUSE_FS (L2871), TIME_NS (L229) and VIRTIO_VSOCKETS
# (L1581) are already `y` there.
CONFIG_HWMON=y
CONFIG_THERMAL_HWMON=y
CONFIG_FUSE_FS=y
CONFIG_TIME_NS=y
CONFIG_VIRTIO_VSOCKETS=y
